Package: matrisaver
Version: @VERSION@
Section: x11
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: ophiocus <1540596+ophiocus@users.noreply.github.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/ophiocus/matrisaver
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.34)
Recommends: mesa-vulkan-drivers | libgl1-mesa-dri
Suggests: swayidle | xautolock | xss-lock
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Description: Matrix-inspired digital rain screensaver
 MatriSaver renders the Matrix code cascade in native Rust on wgpu, with
 five film-derived variants, an ASCII overlay that dissolves silhouettes
 into the rain, and a per-variant 3D compositor for the Reloaded look.
 .
 Playback spans every monitor with one continuous scene: the rain does
 not restart at a bezel. Vulkan is preferred, with an explicit fall back
 to GL and a diagnostic line naming the rung that was reached.
 .
 MatriSaver is a screensaver, not a screen locker. It deliberately does
 not authenticate or block input beyond its own window; locking stays
 the desktop session's job. Integration helpers for swayidle, xautolock
 and xss-lock ship in /usr/share/matrisaver/integration.
